    "message": "We have identified an issue with our latest Pendo mobile SDK version 3.7.0.9285 for iOS that will cause applications to be rejected upon submission to Apple's App Store. Please use pendo-sdk-ios-xamarin-forms version 3.7.0.9334 or later",
