    ]
  },
  "description": "We recommend using the pendo-xamarin-forms NuGet if your app supports both iOS and Android. This Pendo SDK NuGet is for iOS apps that are implemented with Xamarin Forms 5. The Pendo platform allows product owners to track user behavior and deliver personal experiences through highly targeted, native in-app surveys, guides, and announcements.",
